    {
      "id": "start",
      "label": "Get started",
      "nav_label": "Get started",
      "landing": "guides/get-started.md",
      "intro": "Start with [Set up your first agent](/tutorials/first-agent): use the desktop app for the simplest setup, or choose the Python package for a terminal-launched browser console. The tutorial also includes a source-checkout route for developers.\n\nFinish when your model answers a first message, then continue to [Use protoAgent](/guides/use-protoagent). If the app will not open, start with [Troubleshooting](/guides/troubleshooting#app-won-t-open).",
      "groups": [
        {
          "label": "Install and connect",
          "pages": [
            "tutorials/first-agent.md"
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "Platform help",
          "pages": [
            "guides/windows-desktop.md"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "use",
      "label": "Use protoAgent",
      "nav_label": "Use",
      "landing": "guides/use-protoagent.md",
      "intro": "Chat, work with files, connect tools, and manage your data.\n\nStart with [Use the app](/guides/react-tauri-ui) for chat and controls. Choose [files](/guides/documents-and-files) to work on a document, [knowledge sources](/guides/ingestion) to remember material for later, or [plugins](/guides/plugin-registry) and [MCP](/guides/mcp) to connect tools. If something fails, start with [Troubleshooting](/guides/troubleshooting).",
      "groups": [
        {
          "label": "Chat and models",
          "pages": [
