      "id": "build",
      "label": "Build & extend",
      "nav_label": "Build",
      "landing": "guides/extend.md",
      "intro": "Use settings for model and persona changes, [skills](/guides/skills) for reusable procedures, and [MCP](/guides/mcp) for existing external tools. Build a plugin for new tools, routes, background work, or views; fork the core when your change needs it.\n\nPlugins run with server privileges. A separate MCP process is not automatically a sandbox. Read [Plugin architecture](/explanation/plugin-architecture) before choosing an extension boundary.",
      "groups": [
